{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/15f42835384336fb45f7c40d51f84451.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the hospital with no memories. They tell you that you were found among the survivors of a landslide that buried a small village called Inusai, with only some spare change in your pocket. Nobody knows who you are or where you came from, but you are undoubtedly connected to the village in some way. Determined to uncover what happened to you, you set off to investigate the site, hoping that something will trigger at least some fleeting memory. Everything becomes even more complicated when you discover the village is still completely intact and its residents are behaving as if nothing happened. Very soon, however, you realize you can no longer leave, and that nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/4cf3b4f0c6d270232516f974f800f8ad.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, take on the role of Yuuki and work alongside Ihayase Araka, sent by The Exorcist Association to investigate the eerie village that should have been buried beneath the landslide. Disguised as a detective, interrogate villagers and assist other survivors who are stuck in the village just like you. Make choices along the way that will shape your path and determine your success\u2014or your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/7e13c1d68a7c2e3c7f4d5e3364cbe6fe.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/bc7eaf4810ab49022043cc8c1ffee5b1.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/664ca869772abe17d6033f968bc83965.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/dd2b9505de432f8a1735ad2327934132.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/1f88bda9f5e3f52979fdce187f8fe331.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/3d968564229694e0c8a0d5f245985c96.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face decisions along the way that will shape your journey.  Some choices might save a life, or might even lead to your early demise, so tread carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than one ending, and not all of them end in a happily ever after.  Can you uncover them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World to Get Drawn Into</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts a winding story story filled with rich lore, engaging dialogue, and mysteries to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Lost Chapter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443640/2fdf324c3cb0e504f75a07b5e3933e99dd017fde.jpg"},{"name":"A Place That Shouldn\u2019t Be","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443640/7a1f413d22a47a95ad689e07bacacfcde032ca04.jpg"},{"name":"The Path Unfollowed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443640/f1a2f060c319017a73ac71be3d31d16cacb34141.jpg"},{"name":"Lost to the Shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443640/b75b07283d03f360e749e10c2f6b27dc85b55fb5.jpg"},{"name":"Dream\u2019s End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3443640/24018003f0225c473311f75c65e6cd4600d5e1c2.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443640?t=1767833671","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767833671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/a6d647e85f454afae686255c400fbce15d9422b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767833671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/a6d647e85f454afae686255c400fbce15d9422b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767833671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/15f42835384336fb45f7c40d51f84451.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the hospital with no memories. They tell you that you were found among the survivors of a landslide that buried a small village called Inusai, with only some spare change in your pocket. Nobody knows who you are or where you came from, but you are undoubtedly connected to the village in some way. Determined to uncover what happened to you, you set off to investigate the site, hoping that something will trigger at least some fleeting memory. Everything becomes even more complicated when you discover the village is still completely intact and its residents are behaving as if nothing happened. Very soon, however, you realize you can no longer leave, and that nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/4cf3b4f0c6d270232516f974f800f8ad.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, take on the role of Yuuki and work alongside Ihayase Araka, sent by The Exorcist Association to investigate the eerie village that should have been buried beneath the landslide. Disguised as a detective, interrogate villagers and assist other survivors who are stuck in the village just like you. Make choices along the way that will shape your path and determine your success\u2014or your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/7e13c1d68a7c2e3c7f4d5e3364cbe6fe.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/bc7eaf4810ab49022043cc8c1ffee5b1.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/664ca869772abe17d6033f968bc83965.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/dd2b9505de432f8a1735ad2327934132.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/1f88bda9f5e3f52979fdce187f8fe331.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443640/extras/3d968564229694e0c8a0d5f245985c96.avif?t=1767833671\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face decisions along the way that will shape your journey.  Some choices might save a life, or might even lead to your early demise, so tread carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than one ending, and not all of them end in a happily ever after.  Can you uncover them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World to Get Drawn Into</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts a winding story story filled with rich lore, engaging dialogue, and mysteries to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kenshisuki Square"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","